    <string name="ui_privacy_policy">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_hero_title">Your data stays on your device</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_hero_body">Phizyo Studio works locally first; cloud backup is entirely optional.</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_overview">Overview</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_overview_body">Phizyo Studio is an app that works locally on your device first: every case, patient, treatment program or chat you save stays stored on your device first. The only exception is the cloud backup of patient files, which is off by default and only works if you turn it on yourself in Settings (see the &quot;Cloud backup&quot; card below).</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_local_title">Data stored locally</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_local_body">•  The custom clinical cases you add.&#10;•  Basic patient details (name, contact, notes) that you enter yourself.&#10;•  Saved physiotherapy treatment programs.&#10;•  Your Semo AI chat history.&#10;•  Your preferences (dark/light mode, favorites, custom Semo AI instructions).&#10;&#10;All of the above is kept in the app\'s private storage on your device, and is permanently deleted if you uninstall the app or clear its data from system settings.</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_online_title">When does the app go online?</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_online_body">Only when you use Semo AI or look up extra background knowledge. In that case, your device connects directly (with no intermediary of ours) to one of two places:&#10;&#10;•  Physiopedia only (a specialized physiotherapy reference; general knowledge search with no key or sign-up, and no searching outside this scope).&#10;•  One fixed Cloudflare Worker link dedicated to the Semo AI assistant, built into the app itself and not changeable from Settings.&#10;&#10;The text of your question, and the latest messages of the same chat (as short-term context that helps the assistant understand what you mean), are what gets sent to them to generate the reply; no patient data or personal file is sent automatically in the background.</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_backup_title">Cloud backup (optional)</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_backup_body">Off by default. If you turn it on from Settings, your patient files (name, phone, sessions, payments, notes) are uploaded to the app\'s own Firebase Firestore database, linked only to your device identifier (anonymous authentication, with no name or email). No other user can access your data, and you can turn the feature off or delete your cloud data at any time from Settings.</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_worker_title">The fixed Cloudflare Worker link</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_worker_body">The Semo AI assistant relies on a single Worker deployed on Cloudflare by the app team, with no API key and no alternative provider. We have no access to any personal data about you through this Worker, only the text of your question and the custom instructions you added yourself (if any) at the time each message is sent.</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_noads_title">No ads and no tracking</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_noads_body">The app shows no ads and contains no tracking library or user-behavior analytics (Analytics/Ads SDK).</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_contact_title">Contact</string>
    <string name="ui_pp_contact_body">For any question about this policy or the app, contact the app development team directly through the support channels that come with the app.</string>
